969	 *
970	 * INCIDENT H4 (2026-07-26 rehearsal): this handler gated only the vzdump task's
971	 * exit status — it never checked that an archive was written, had no failure
972	 * notification, and `Server.lastAutoBackup` was stamped by the SWEEP at enqueue
